# Chronicle's own documentation, kept locally as reference while building.
#
# It is NOT this repository's to publish. Chronicle's root licence reserves
# essentially all rights, and the only file carved out of it is the CC0 schema in
# contracts/. Committing a proprietary document here is precisely the provenance
# problem this repository exists at arm's length to avoid - "it used to live inside a
# proprietary repo" is not an answer to give a buyer's lawyer.
docs/Portfolio-*.md
docs/software-city-CLAUDE.md.template

